{"sectionId":"organic_rxn/mechanisms","items":[{"id":"organic_rxn--mechanisms-k001","sectionId":"organic_rxn/mechanisms","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"친핵체는 전자쌍을 제공하고 친전자체는 전자쌍을 받아 새 결합을 형성한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--mechanisms-k002","sectionId":"organic_rxn/mechanisms","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"곡선 화살표는 전자쌍 이동의 시작점과 도착점을 나타낸다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--mechanisms-k003","sectionId":"organic_rxn/mechanisms","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"결합의 heterolysis는 전자쌍이 한쪽으로 이동하고 homolysis는 한 전자씩 나뉜다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--mechanisms-k004","sectionId":"organic_rxn/mechanisms","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"carbocation은 전자 부족한 탄소로 공명·hyperconjugation 및 치환에 의해 안정화될 수 있으며 hydride 또는 alkyl shift로 재배열될 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--mechanisms-k005","sectionId":"organic_rxn/mechanisms","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"carbanion의 안정성은 공명·전자끌개와 혼성 등에 영향을 받는다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--mechanisms-k006","sectionId":"organic_rxn/mechanisms","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"radical 반응은 개시, 전파, 종결 단계로 설명할 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--mechanisms-k007","sectionId":"organic_rxn/mechanisms","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"alkane의 halogenation은 radical 치환의 대표 예이며 bromination은 일반적으로 chlorination보다","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--mechanisms-k008","sectionId":"organic_rxn/mechanisms","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"선택성이 크다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--mechanisms-k009","sectionId":"organic_rxn/mechanisms","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"반응의 regioselectivity는 어느 위치에서 반응하는지, stereoselectivity는 어떤 입체생성물이 우세한지, stereospecificity는 반응물 입체배치에 따라 생성물 입체배치가 정해지는지를 말한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--mechanisms-k010","sectionId":"organic_rxn/mechanisms","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"화살표는 전자 있는 곳에서 시작한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--mechanisms-k011","sectionId":"organic_rxn/mechanisms","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"carbocation 재배열은 더 안정한 중간체로 갈 수 있다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--mechanisms-k012","sectionId":"organic_rxn/mechanisms","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"친핵성은 반응속도에 관련된 성질, 염기성은 평형 성질이다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--mechanisms-k013","sectionId":"organic_rxn/mechanisms","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"라디칼은 홀전자를 가진 종이다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--mechanisms-k014","sectionId":"organic_rxn/mechanisms","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"1,2-hydride 또는 alkyl shift 등 재배열 때문이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]}]}